    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GSF301 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14315 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GSF301 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14315 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">8-9 weeks</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,2,3,4,5,6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Divide the class into 4 or 6 groups. Each group will select a global/ Vietnamese air freight carriers and conduct an in-depth analysis of its air freight operations. The report should cover: 1. Company background and industry context 2. Air fleet (types and roles of aircraft used) 3. Main air freight services offered 4. Operational process for handling air cargo 5. Technologies used to streamline operations 6. Common operational issues and company’s solutions to tackle these issues.OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: Report's length: 3500-4000 wordsOP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">OPT1: All chapters and learning materials covered in the course.OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Take-Home and Classroom, following lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 46 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Session 47 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Session 48 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Session 49 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 50 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 51 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 52 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 53 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 54 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 46 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Buổi 47 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Buổi 48 — Individual Assignment</li><li>Buổi 49 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 50 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 51 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 52 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 53 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 54 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=GSF301\">Exam Room — GSF301</a> (2 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=GSF301\">Phòng thi — GSF301</a> (2 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
